Comment:
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's (Capitain Jack) edition of SparkyLinux
 (https://sparkylinux.org, by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski).
 .
 The page's layout (the list, the small preview beside it, the full-screen
 button under it, the times) is the one of KDE's Screen Saver control module,
 kcontrol/screensaver of kde-workspace, last released in KDE Workspace
 4.11.22 and removed in 2013; no code of it is used. Its authors, from its
 file headers: Matthias Hoelzer (1997), Martin R. Jones (1996, 1999, 2002),
 Chris Howells (2004), Benjamin Meyer (2007-2008), Hamish Rodda (2007-2008),
 Dario Andres Rodriguez (2009) and Davide Bettio (2009).
 .
 The savers are XScreenSaver's, by Jamie Zawinski and each saver's own
 authors, whom the page names beside the saver. The frame channel and the
 declared surface are adapted from the edition's gl-stereo (GPL-2.0-or-later).

